         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               SubframeQualityReview: Adds undo for moved originals, including restoration from saved move journals, and Good/Medium/Bad eccentricity bands. Improves REVIEW explanations, clears Measure corners when relevant settings change, and places Log folder before Rejected originals.
